window.products.push({"id":469208,"name":"Better Life Attic 31ft Pre-lit Ivy Leaves Lights, Greenery Garland with Fairy Lights, Battery Operated Artificial Vines for Bedroom, Wedding, Indoor, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91AkJ9bqXML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[AESTHETIC & EASY] Our ivy vine light will not only make your space more beautiful but it will radically affect your mood and emotions as well. Transform your room a little forest magic. We handcrafted to twist the ivy vine strands and the LED light wires. You simply decorate with our ready-to-use ivy string lights to create a unique look that reflects your own aesthetic taste. [IVY VINE LIGHT PACKAGE INCLUDES] This ivy greenery string light you receive is 31ft long ivy garland with a copper wire containing 100 micro LEDs and a 3AA battery holder. (Batteries are not included.) The ivy vine garland and the string light are already twisted. The artificial leaf garland holds about 280 leaves and the leaf sizes are 1 ¾”x1 ¾”(big leaf) and 1 ½”x1 ½”(small leaf). [REALISTIC GREENERY] Lifelike green leaves are made of high quality faux silk fabric. Each leaf is carefully dyed and shaped to have a natural and realistic appearance. The soft and flexible stems are made of plastic, which can be easily bent and shaped. Our ivy fake plants hang down naturally and enhance the visual appearance of your home decoration. [PRE-ATTACHED LIGHTS] The LED copper wire completely intertwined the ivy strand. No Assembly required. The light and the vine are not separated unlike others. [BEAUTIFUL GLOW] The faux ivy garland hang vine has tiny micro 100 LEDs in a warm white color(2700k), which creates the perfect balance of warmth, coziness and function in your room. The LED lights will not overheat during usage and remain cool to touch. The jungle vine garland lights can take on a whole new personality at night and are absolutely stunning. [ALMOST INVISIBLE WIRE] The copper wire is very delicate but sturdy enough. The fine wire is hidden in daylight when not in use and the beautiful warm light effect stands out after dusk. [CORDLESS] This fake vine garland with LED string lights is powered by 3AA batteries (not included). The compact battery holder has an on/off slide switch. The decorative leaves with lights are portable and easy to use! [REQUIRES ZERO MAINTENANCE] Our faux plant with firefly lights gives your space a natural greenery touch without the hassle of watering. Easy! Breezy! Green forever! [WIDELY USED] Artificial ivy leaf vines with lights are perfect for bedroom décor, wedding archways, wedding decorations, table centerpieces, bridal shower decorations, aesthetic room décor, canopy décor, banisters, staircase, bookshelf, fireplace mantel décor, balcony decorations, vanity décor, safari jungle theme party, forest party, dinner party decorations, trade show booth displace, trendy restaurant décor, home office inspiration, vine décor for wall and so much more. [WARM TIPS] (1) If the fairy lights get dimmer, please replace the batteries with new ones. (2) The artificial ivy vines may possibly emanate an unpleasant but harmless odor when you open the package. Please place them in a ventilated place. The smell will dissipate.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91AkJ9bqXML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Better Life Attic","source_asin":"B0BPH8J3DZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-469208","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BPH8J3DZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BPH8J3DZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
