window.products.push({"id":469330,"name":"Wine Aerator, A Wine Aerator Provided for Everyone and Wine Enthusiasts, With Base (Clear)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715dap+RCnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❤ Unique handheld wine aerator: an innovative three-layer aerator system, the wine is filtered through the ultra-dense filter screen at the entrance, enters the air mixing chamber to fully mix the wine with the oxygen in the air, and then aerates through a long funnel. Based on Bernoulli's principle, the wine flowing out of the funnel has its own flavor at this time, and it can be tasted directly without waiting. ❤ Smooth Taste: It comes from the fine filtration of sediment or cork chips in the wine to promote natural oxidation, ensure that you can enjoy pure wine without impurities, and ensure that it really improves the quality of wine. ❤ Clear Selection of High-quality Materials: high-quality acrylic is selected as the main material, without BPA, the crystal texture is clear, and the base is processed with high-end imitation wood grain, which can be used for decoration when not in use. ❤ Simple and Convenient: small size, easy to carry in small size travel bag, suitable for travel and dinner, and because it is filtered in advance, it is easy to clean the inside of its body, just need to wash it with water. ❤ For Wine Lovers: This is a wine aerator decanter that is very popular with wine lovers. It can be said to be a necessary item for wine lovers, and it is also very suitable for friends, relatives and familiar wine lovers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715dap+RCnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Qbily","source_asin":"B0BXCPZ6VX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-469330","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BXCPZ6VX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BXCPZ6VX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
