window.products.push({"id":469376,"name":"Canning Kit Canning Tools Canning Set Canning Supplies Include Canning Funnel, Jar Lifter, Jar Wrench, Lid Lifter, Canning Tongs, Bubble Popper/Bubble","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616wX0e8oFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This Canning Essentials Set includes: 1 x Long tongs with red vinyl coated handles  1 x Vinyl coated jar lifter  1 x Magnetic lid lifter 1 x Extra wide mouth funnel  1 x Vinyl coated jar wrench  1 x Bubble popper/measurer. Jar Lifter： Designed to safely remove any size canning jar from boiling water, you don't need to worry about burned fingertips or scalded hands. Easy lifting vinyl coated grip clamps securely on jar tops, reducing the chance of breakage. Jar Wrench This jar wrench made of plated steel material that tightens lids effortlessly, are essential to screw lids off or on jars,ensuring your preserves and canned goods will stay fresh. Wide-Mouth Funnel Extra-wide mouth funnel transfers large quantities of liquids or dry ingredients with fewer spills and mess. Perfect for canning.Fits both regular mouth and wide mouth jars. Canning tongs Long tongs with red vinyl handle to keep sterilized canning components sanitary before/during and after use. Magnetic Lid Lifter Safely removing canning lids from hot canning water. Helps to keep lids seal sterilized. Bubble Remover Tool To measure the head space in jars and to pop any air bubbles in the food before sealing. The jam making kit allows you to easily make a variety of jams at home. Essential for home canning and preserving fresh produce.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616wX0e8oFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hiscate","source_asin":"B08SGJ1YGC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-469376","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08SGJ1YGC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08SGJ1YGC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":469377,"name":"NAPA FORGE 18500 Pilgrim Ash Holder, Matte Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":139.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51aNaIIYDOL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"A Pilgrim original design. Keep the home safe when tending the fireplace or wood stove. Coals can stay hot for days, and ashes must be stored in a safe container. The fit and finish make our ash holder stand above the rest. A piano-hinged lid keeps ashes in and wooden handles protect your hands when handling. Our ash holders legs help to avoid scorching. Available in matte black, our holder fits well in all types of décor. Don’t be fooled by cheap imitations.A Pilgrim Original DesignLifetime GuaranteePilgrim Home and Hearth a US based leading designer, manufacturer and wholesale distributor of high quality Hearth & Home fireplace and home décor accessories for over 65 years. Pilgrim is trusted by millions of families to be at the center of the home with beautiful fireplace screens, fireplace tool sets and hundreds of unique home décor solutions. Pilgrim’s success is based on thoughtful design, honest materials, careful craftsmanship and lasting customer satisfaction. Pilgrim is a strategic OEM partner for some of the most influential and respected retail brands in the country. The fireplace accessories from Pilgrim’s collections are regularly featured on movie sets, design and architectural publications. Pilgrim manufactures a broad collection of fresh décor essentials designed for every style of home and fireplace all backed by Pilgrim’s legendary Lifetime Quality Guarantee. Remember, the consequence of poor quality lingers long after the thrill of a bargain is forgotten.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51aNaIIYDOL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NAPA FORGE","source_asin":"B0010AVRFG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-469377","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0010AVRFG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0010AVRFG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
