window.products.push({"id":469528,"name":"Ciroa Set of 4 Mini Loaf Pans White Porcelain Individual Bakers 6 Inch 11 fl oz Capacity Honeycomb Design","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51k3kJCXDaL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"High quality porcelain is the perfect material to bake that smaller sized meal, perfect for entertaining - your mini casserole, loaf or terrine will look great served directly from the pan itself. The high gloss classic white glaze highlights the intricate honeycomb pattern that is so popular with our favourite customers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51k3kJCXDaL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ciroa","source_asin":"B07Z74J894","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-469528","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Z74J894","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Z74J894","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":469529,"name":"Sovaro 45 Quart Luxury Wine/Spirit Cooler, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":364.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Gyi+3AkmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Make outdoor entertaining a breeze with the Sovaro 45 Quart Luxury Wine/Spirit Cooler. This elegant cooler keeps your beverages cold while the stylish exterior adds a luxury accent to your home's outdoor space. The cork insulation is fully encapsulated between polycarbonate and resists temperatures up to 1,000 degrees. A one-touch latch provides easy access to food and beverages. Friction hinges on the lid allow the cooler to open and close easily. A drainage plug makes the cooler incredibly simple to clean, and a set of wheels and a telescopic handle allow you to cart it wherever the good times are rolling. Measuring 28.13\" x 16.63\" x 17.75\", the Sovaro 45 Quart Luxury Wine/Spirit Cooler holds 10 wine or spirit bottles standing upright. With an eye to serious style that is elegant in its simplicity, SOVARO luxury products accentuate every unforgettable experience. We stand committed to exceeding your expectations through exceptional and innovative products and experiences that are thoughtfully designed to complement your style for years to come. From the Manufacturer Performance SOVARO coolers leverage the austere beauty and natural insulating properties of cork, a material proven to withstand forest fires and resist temperatures up to 1,000°F. Fully encapsulated in a polycarbonate shell 12.6 times stronger than standard plastic, our coolers employ a unique, four-layer barrier system, providing extreme protection from the elements. Style Available in bold black or white, SOVARO coolers embody consummate luxury and style. Each bold line and eye-catching accent is seamlessly integrated to make an impression at any event. Cork Insulation Natural insulation and timeless beauty. Mobililty Uncompromised style and performance wherever life takes you. Accessories Customize your cooler with convenient accessories. About the Startup Describe your product in 3 words. Entertain in style. How did you come up with the idea for this product? We believe your cooler should complement every occasion. Our intent with SOVARO is to deliver a fashion-forward luxury product loaded with smart features to make the good times even greater. What makes your product special? We commit to authenticity and innovation in every facet of design, from the hand-harvested cork sourced from Portuguese oak trees to the spacious interior, which enables wine and spirits bottle to be stored upright. The telescoping extension handle and heavy-duty, luggage-style wheels provide unmatched mobility, while the magnesium side handles and rear drainage plug allow for easy handling and cleaning with every use. Other innovations include the airtight rubber gasket and one-touch latch to ensure a perfect seal, friction hinges to keep the lid open during use, and a transparent liner to preserve the aesthetic of the cork. What has been the best part of your startup experience? Since its outset, this endeavor has been an incredible adventure. I’ve met many wonderful individuals with whom I’ve been fortunate enough to share insight and perspective—and a few drinks! It is to each of you that SOVARO is humbly dedicated. Cheers!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Gyi+3AkmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sovaro","source_asin":"B01ERY76B0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-469529","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01ERY76B0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01ERY76B0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":469530,"name":"CafePress Goat Dive Flag Tote Bag Natural Canvas Tote Bag, Reusable Shopping Bag","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/4131MaB554L._AC_.jpg","description":"Your New Favorite Bag: Make a statement with a fun and functional canvas tote bag that shows off your unique personality. This versatile, multipurpose classic is sure to become your go-to reusable, foldable bag that is perfect for shopping, work, or vacation. Two Sizes: Small tote measures 15\" x 15 x 6\" with 26.5\" handles. Medium tote measures 15\" x 18\" x 6\" with 22\" handles. Each tote size features reinforced handles and full side and bottom support gussets for strength and durability. Professionally Printed: Our tote bags are imported from our trusted partners. Then each tote is expertly printed with sharp and vivid graphics using premium inks by our USA printing partner. Our quality totes are built to last: construction, design and graphic design placement. Easy To Care For Eco-Friendly Carryall Option: No need to use more plastic grocery bags, wasteful wrapping paper or other one time use products. Use for everyday errands, to present gifts, stow away items and organize with our minimalist tote bags. Once our cotton canvas bags become soiled, simply spot clean or place in washing machine on your favorite cold setting. Machine dry on low heat or hang dry. Ideal Everyday Tote or Gift : Treat yourself or surprise family members, friends, colleagues or your favorite teacher. Our beautifully designed cotton canvas tote bags make a unique and thoughtful present for Christmas, Easter, Mother's Day, birthdays, back-to-school, weddings, anniversary and so much more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/4131MaB554L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CafePress","source_asin":"B0BQWWXHXP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-469530","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BQWWXHXP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BQWWXHXP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
