window.products.push({"id":469551,"name":"Copper Heat Diffuser Cooking Plate 10\" for Cooktop or Stove","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41u1XIbvmTL._AC_.jpg","description":"Your solid copper plate is made of pure domestic 14 gauge copper. Please read our use and care before using. ● These diffuser plates are perfectly safe to use with gas and electric cook tops. Copper is non magnetic, the diffuser will not work on magnetic induction cooking surfaces. We suggest a maximum of medium/high with glass cook tops - just to be on the safe side. Benefits and uses: ● Maintain even temperature when cooking or baking. ● Large pan, small burner? Use a diffuser that is the size of the bottom of your pan for even temperatures! ● Great for simmering, making candy, making the perfect omelette, etc. ● Pies now can brown on the top and bottom more effectively. ● Make perfect risotto, fudge, candy or sauce without nearly as much stirring. ● Thaw frozen items quickly, as copper transfers heat faster than all other metals, (other than silver) including aluminum. ● Use as a cooling plate for hot items. ● A solid copper diffuser with heat up 500% faster than iron or steel heat diffusers and will keep temperatures more even. ● Less burning and sticking while cooking ● Use with cast iron to spread heat evenly to the entire bottom of the pot or pan. Did you know copper is over 5 times as effective transferring heat than cast iron is? Due to the poor heat conductivity of cast iron, hot and cold spots are common. These issues are resolved using our copper diffuser. Also, notable, copper is over 20 times more efficient at transferring heat than stainless! ● Use on your outdoor grill to place a pot of pan for more even cooking ● Thick soups, pasta sauce, rice, beans are less likely to burn and stick with our copper diffuser. ● Works well with ceramic stove top cooking items.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41u1XIbvmTL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sonvera","source_asin":"B01M7O0PDW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-469551","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01M7O0PDW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01M7O0PDW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
