window.products.push({"id":469658,"name":"Fire Sense 60523 Pyramid Flame Patio Heater 40,000 BTU Outdoor Propane Heater Tower with Wheels - Stainless Steel & Full Length Outdoor Flame Patio He","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":315.63,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/515tWZHiJcL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Fire Sense Stainless Steel Pyramid Flame Heater with Wheels | Beautiful Tall Flame | Uses 20 Pound Propane Tank | 40,000 BTU Output | Portable Outdoor and Patio Heat LampEnjoy your patio in all seasons with this Stainless Steel Pyramid Flame Heater with Wheels by Fire Sense. This outdoor propane patio heater spreads the heat all around you so that you can easily enjoy being outdoors even during chilly weather. It will effortlessly keep you and your loved ones warm and toasty so that you do not have to stay indoors. The propane heater features an electronic ignition system that will turn on the heater in an instant so that you do not have to wait around for the air around you to be heated. Also, this way you only use the fuel you need. This gas patio heater uses a 20 pound LP gas cylinder which is not included with your purchase and produces a heat output of 40,000 BTU. This propane tank will last you approximately 10 hours. The heavy duty convenient wheels allow you to easily navigate and position this propane patio heater in the perfect spot for your outdoor entertainment. This outdoor propane heater for patio also comes with a weighted base and a tip over protection system so you do not have to worry about the propane patio heater accidentally falling over. It also comes with a safety auto shut off tilt valve for additional safety. This stylish unit provides a uniquely visual flame while providing heat in every direction. The superior burner technology and built in emitter enables this unit to produce more heat than any other flame heater on the market. This Fire Sense patio heater is the perfect solution for any outdoor gatherings you want to have during the winters and is an attractive piece of functional art that will be the focal point of any outdoor setting.Fire Sense 60949 Full Length Outdoor Flame Patio Heater Vinyl Cover, Large, MulticolorProtect your patio heater in all seasons with this Full Length Outdoor Flame Patio Heater Cover by Fire Sense. This propane patio heater cover is made from heavy duty 10 gauge black vinyl. This will ensure that your patio heater is protected and at the same time, there are no possible scratches on its surface. The propane heater cover is lined with felt ensuring that your patio heater is always protected, no matter what the season. Due to its vinyl construction, this cover is waterproof and weather resistant. It will ensure that your patio heater is protected, come hail or storm. The best part about this gas heater cover is that it will provide full coverage to your standing patio heater and helps elongate the life of your patio heater. This Fire Sense patio heater cover zips open and closed with ease and allows for easy removal. After buying this cover, you will no longer have to worry about keeping an eye out for the clouds and can simply put the cover on and forget about it. This allows you peace of mind and also means you do not have to search for space in your house every time it rains. The waterproof patio heater cover with zipper also protects your patio heater from dust and keeps it cleaner for longer, thus keeping it shiny, attractive, and looking like new.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/515tWZHiJcL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fire Sense","source_asin":"B074GBV483","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-469658","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074GBV483","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074GBV483","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
