window.products.push({"id":469669,"name":"Peugeot Les Impitoyables Glass Number Four for Sparkling Wines","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71t9s5mDZ3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"For more than a century, the Peugeot name has been synonymous with French gourmet cooking. Recently, an opportunity arose for Peugeot to bring its penchant for quality and innovation to a family of wine products. With the Les Impitoyables collection, tasting becomes perfection. The literal translation of Les Impitoyables is, \"The Pitiless\" because theses glasses reveal everything about a wine – the good and the bad. As tools created for professionals, Les Impitoyables glasses intensify the characteristics of wine by enhancing their qualities or bringing out the slightest flaw. There are 5 glasses that make up the Les Impitoyables line, (represented by numbers 1, 2, 3, and 4, plus Le Taster), each with a specific purpose. Every glass in the collection is a unique, handmade piece, (lead free), and is authenticated by a signature on the foot. The Number Four glass is intended for use with Champagne and Sparkling Wines. A pointed cone at the base of the bowl causes bubbles to form a column, which encourages aeration. The inside walls have a diamond pattern coating which catches the mousse (and gives a good indication of a wines maturity). Tube contains one Number 4 Glass.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71t9s5mDZ3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Peugeot","source_asin":"B0013SPTHC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-469669","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0013SPTHC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0013SPTHC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
