window.products.push({"id":469671,"name":"Simplify 6 Inch Bed Riser | Pack of 4 | Bed & Furniture Lifter Wheel Grooves | Under-Bed Storage | Bedroom & Dorm | Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.32,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qAs74cujL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"For the individuals who experience issues ascending from sofas or beds, these 6 inch bed risers permit tallness of each household item to be balanced for enhanced use. The non-slide, chair lifts are protected on any level floor surface including carpet and hardwood floors. Do you ever struggle standing up out of furniture that is too low? These low profile 6-inch tall bed risers wheels are the solution. Specially developed to boost seat by raising low sitting furniture to a safer and more comfortable height level. Bed risers are a fantastic way to gain approximately 6-inches of storage space. Bed table risers are also great for medical use, two under the front of the bed can help improve circulation in the legs. These bed risers give you storage space you never had before. These sturdy blocks instantly elevate your bed for up to 6-Inch of additional under-bed storage space, perfect for those extra large storage bins. Sofa table risers are engineered to be incredibly strong. These bed risers are perfect for any room furniture set.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qAs74cujL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Simplify","source_asin":"B0794797QN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-469671","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0794797QN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0794797QN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":469672,"name":"InterDesign Forma Over-The-Tank Roll Reserve, Brushed Stainless Steel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.27,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GTWVksUnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Is space crunch in your bathroom and toilet an issue? With this stainless steel Forma Over Tank Roll Reserve, space worries need not be a predicament anymore. Lift the lid off the flush tank and hook this Roll Reserve on the side of the flush tank. Then place the lid back on the flush tank and you are all set. This metal hook can hold up to 2 toilet rolls for easy reach and convenience. With two rolls for use, you need never fear running out of toilet tissue ever again. The stainless steel matches the color of your tank and your bathroom decor. The bar reduces the of toilet paper rolls clutter in your bathroom.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GTWVksUnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"InterDesign","source_asin":"B004KKXA8U","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-469672","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004KKXA8U","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004KKXA8U","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
