window.products.push({"id":469732,"name":"FASHION in THE CITY Large 3D DIY Wall Clock Frameless Mirror Surface Big Wall Clock Home Decoration for Living Room Bedroom Office Coffee Hall Bar Wal","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QMzG5PXaL._AC_SL1049_.jpg","description":"1.Stickers Made of EVA Foam Material and Mirror Material, Which is Non Toxic and Non Fading, Can Last for About 3-5 Years. 2.Stickers Can be Removable ,With Glue on The Backside, Easy to Paste on The Wall or Any Other Clean and Smooth Surface; Such As Door ,the closet and so on 3.The mirror with glue, before to paste the sticker on the wall, you need to paste the mirror on the sticker surface first 4. DIY design, clock layout size measured by hands, can be adjust to be smaller or bigger size this is a 3D DIY wall clock,very nice one,high quality one. Sticker Material: EVA Foam (Ethylene vinyl acetate) Clock Material: Metal Hour Hand: 27.5cm Minute Hand: 33.5cm Clock Machine: 10cm Battery:1.5V AA battery 1 piece(without) The round pattern size:120X120CM The clock final decoration size is decided by how you want to decorate you walls. Choose color:Black Silver Gold Red (Has Mirror Acrylic Pieces) Packing: 1x Clock stickers 1x Clock mechanism Without battery How to Install? STEP1:Fasten the clock movement on the wall STEP2:peel off protection film from mirror,stick it on the EVA number.Cover the clock movement with the auxiliary scale,stick the numbers at the right site according to the scale. STEP3:Take down the clock movement,fixing the hour hand ,then minute hand.Tips:press the clock hands into the clock axle and point at 12 o'clock. STEP4:Adjust the time by button on the clock movement and install the battery. STEP5:Hanging the clock movement on the wall. STEP6:Well done!You can enjoy your art-work now(No retail packaging)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QMzG5PXaL._AC_SL1049_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FASHION in THE CITY","source_asin":"B0BQ7BRNSM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-469732","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BQ7BRNSM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BQ7BRNSM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
