window.products.push({"id":469753,"name":"Portmeirion Botanic Garden Square Dinner Plates, Set of 6 Assorted Motifs","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51RNzuHQJhL._AC_.jpg","description":"Over 30 years ago, Susan Williams-Ellis created the world-renowned Botanic Garden Pattern. Today it is one of the top-selling patterns of all time. With over thirty flowers gracing the large array of items available, this pattern has truly become a collectable treasure and a bright and beautiful way to decorate your table and home. Assorted flower motifs change as a gardener might change a garden landscape. The constant flow of new items will help you make your Portmeirion garden grow.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51RNzuHQJhL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Portmeirion","source_asin":"B000Q5ULAS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-469753","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000Q5ULAS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000Q5ULAS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
