window.products.push({"id":469760,"name":"CHESS BED 3-Piece Duvet Cover Set with Hidden Zipper Closure & Corner Ties 600-TC Ultra Soft Pillow Shams Egyptian Cotton Oversize King (98X120) Size ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":86.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/518rsQHiMTL._AC_.jpg","description":"3-Piece Duvet Cover Set with Hidden Zipper Closure & Corner Ties 600-TC Hypoallergenic Ultra Soft Pillow Shams 100% Egyptian Cotton Oversize king (98X120) size Medium Blue Solid SILKY SOFT, PURE COTTON SHEETS FOR ULTIMATE COMFORT - Crafted from extra long staple cotton, our 600 thread count Duvets are silky smooth, light and airy. Unlike artificial microfiber that absorbs heat, traps dusts and builds static, our sheets are breathable, sustainable The sateen weave adds a lustrous sheen to enhance the look of your bedroom. EASY TO MAINTAIN, BEDDING - Made using top notch materials, our bed sheets are machine washable and get softer over time. Each fabric is tested for features such as No -pills, low shrinkage, color fastness to be defect free and finally packed for shipping. To improve durability, warm wash and light dry. Use a short dry cycle and pull your linens from the dryer as soon as it ends to keep it wrinkle resistant. WE GUARANTEE THAT YOU'LL LOVE OUR Duvets - Our products are backed by incredible customer service for 100% satisfaction guarantee. If for any reason you don't like our bedsheets, you can return them within 30 days for a full refund as per Amazon guidelines. Perfect gift for your loved ones and apt for any room in your house - guest, kids room, vacation home. LIVE RESPONSIBLY WITH ETHICALLY MADE LINENS - Our Duvets aren’t made by machines alone. They require the expertise of workers, whom we value for their part in our brand. Our bed linens are ethically manufactured in a certified, socially complaint and awarded factory that supports more than 300 working families.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/518rsQHiMTL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CHESS BED","source_asin":"B08YF6Y5X2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-469760","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08YF6Y5X2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08YF6Y5X2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
