window.products.push({"id":469794,"name":"Leone di Fiume Luxury and Decorative Jar Candle Gift Set for Home Scented, All Natural and Hand-Poured Aromatherapy Soy Candles with Essential Oils fo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Bj9eMT6-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"LUXURY CRAFTSWOMANSHIP: We are here to set the standard in luxury candles and take great pride in sharing our craftswomanship. Every single Leone Di Fiume soy jar candle is produced by skilled artisans and hand-poured using superior-quality 100% natural soy wax with intoxicating, perfume-grade signature fragrances from Europe's top fragrance houses. Each candle jar is hand-crafted and each glass pattern is created and painted by hand. EXPERIENCE A UNIQUE FRAGRANCE: The fragrance of Mini Nude opens with top notes of mandarin, plum, and cyclamen. At the heart of the scent lays jasmine, caramel, and ylang-ylang accords. The base notes are vanilla bean, tonka bean, fruity musk, and sandalwood. The fragrance of Mini Taupe opens with top notes of black pepper, bitter chocolate, and caramel. At the heart of the scent lays cinnamon, black coffee, the hint of burnt sugar. The base notes are amber, patchouli, agarwood, incense, musk. RENEWABLE & BIODEGRADABLE: Our all-natural aromatherapy candles are made of pure soy wax, cotton wick, and a unique blend of essential oils and perfume-grade fragrance oils. All the ingredients used are vegan and give a non-toxic, soot-free, and clean burn. Soy wax is a biodegradable and renewable source. Leone di Fiume soy candles contain zero paraffin. Highly scented Mini Pale Pillows Set comes with 2 small jar candles and each candle of the gift set offers a burn time of 30 hours. SPOIL YOURSELF AND YOUR LOVED ONES: Our one-of-a-kind scented jar candle gift sets will help you to dazzle everyone with exceptional craftswomanship and a divine bouquet of aromas. The inspiring unique design and the elegant gift box make Leone di Fiume candles the perfect gift for any holiday or special events, such as Christmas, birthday, holiday, anniversary, Valentine’s Day, Mother’s Day, housewarming and thank you gifts for women and men. CANDLE CARE: Soy wax has a memory so each time you light the candle allow the melted wax pool to reach the edge of the container to avoid tunneling. And always trim the wick to ¼ inch before each use. Our soy jar candles are designed to be a keepsake after the candle is gone, repurpose the beautiful glass jar using your imagination and add a touch of luxury to your decoration. If you are not satisfied with your purchase, we invite you to take advantage of our full money-back guarantee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Bj9eMT6-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Leone di Fiume","source_asin":"B095YLPQXY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-469794","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B095YLPQXY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B095YLPQXY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":469795,"name":"Cultural Hub® Royal Goblets Wine Glasses 4 Silver Plated Brass Hand Engraved Wine Cups Barware Comes with Beautiful Gift Box Jk-1200-0707 (8.8\" Height","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":115.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31ZIBHXDgmL._AC_.jpg","description":"What if drinking a glass of wine or enjoying any drink of your choice could be turned into a royal treasuring experience? It is very much possible with these intricately carved and designed Wine Goblets that turn drinking into a luxurious royal affair. These glasses look nothing less than elegant, suave and utterly gorgeous.  A thoughtful and useful Gift for a dear one or a client, be it thanksgiving party at your parent’s or aunt’s place, house warming of a friend or relative or a wedding gift for the new couple, this piece fits the occasion making the loved ones feel cherished and delighted. An artsy memento to be gifted and flaunted over the years with durable Brass material increasing its life. Enjoy a drink with that special one in a royal style. The amazingly designed set of 4 Silver Finished shiny Wine Goblets are manufactured with the best quality standards and come packed in red original velvet box casing that has 2 ornate brass colored closures on the front and hinges on the back to secure the box.   The silver plated wine goblets are completely made of Brass metal, known around the world for its strength and wear-resistance properties. This bowl is coated with the best quality silver polish, a perfect blend of strength and beauty. The Exquisite Silver carving on these goblets add an ethnic royal touch to your table and the case they come in has a blue velvet exterior and a different shade of blue satin on the interior. Each cup or goblet sits in its own impression inside the case preventing any mishandling or damage. The box helps gifting and is a perfect case to contain the precious goblets in a protective and safe packaging just like a jewel. It’s a rare vintage collectable item that can grace your dining area.  DISCLAIMER: This product is hand crafted. Minor variations in color, size & design are an inherent character of such products & should not be seen as defects.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31ZIBHXDgmL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cultural Hub","source_asin":"B00MXWYH84","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-469795","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00MXWYH84","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00MXWYH84","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
