window.products.push({"id":469933,"name":"Alta Jumbo Bean Bag Chair (Cover ONLY) Big Sofa Cover Made Stain and Water Resistant for Indoor and Outdoor Use. 63” x 51”, Aqua","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51CrLqOgRCL._AC_SL1005_.jpg","description":"Are You Looking for the Most Comfortable Bean Bag Available? Treat yourself to ultimate bean bag experience and sit back and unwind while you are watching tv, reading your favorite book or playing video games. Here at Alta, we’ve made our bean bag chairs durable, stylish and water resistant at an affordable price. All you need to do is pour your own beans, fill up the inner velcro, lock up the outer safety zip and you're ready to go! Here is What Makes The Alta Jumbo Bean Bag so Special! ✓ FAST AND SIMPLE TO FILL- You can fill it up to your desired level of firmness. Please note; We provide the cover and inner bag only so beans are not included. We recommend 10 cubic feet or 250 litres of polystyrene beans. ✓ PERFECT FOR LAZYING AROUND - Coated with PVC for additional softness and comfort. You can’t help by laze the day away to your favorite music or show whether it's in your living room, family room, dorm or in the basement. Ideal for kids, teenagers and adults. Dimensions 61 x 51 inches or 155 x 130cm. ✓ QUICK AND EASY TO CLEAN- The water resistant and stain proof material helps take care of nasty spills and messes. Simply wipe up with no problems at all. Liquid will have trouble leaking into this bean bag. ✓ 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEED - We proudly stand behind our product and at this price and quality we are sure you wouldn't want to return it. However for any reason you aren’t satisfied, you can take advantage of our 30 day return policy to give you additional peace of mind. WARNING!!! Once your sit back and relax, you won’t want to get back up. Get Yours Today. Click “Add to Cart” Now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51CrLqOgRCL._AC_SL1005_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Alta","source_asin":"B01MV62HGK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-469933","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MV62HGK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MV62HGK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":469934,"name":"InterDesign AFFIXX Plastic Organizer, Peel-and-Stick Strong Self-Adhesive Organizer for Laundry and Utility Room, Closets, Cabinets, 8\" x 3.5\" x 5.5\",","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51tRnPeh0bL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Organize your home with the iDesign AFFIXX Organizer! This sturdy organizer holds up to 3 pounds and is perfect for holding laundry detergent pods and powder, fabric softener, clothespins, and other accessories. Set up is easy - the AFFIXX adhesive backing has a super strong hold that works on metal, mirror, glass, tile, fiberglass, wood, and other smooth surfaces! When you want to remove your organizer, simply take it off the wall. The adhesive is guaranteed to be damage free and remove cleanly without residue. Constructed of clear durable plastic, the AFFIXX Organizer will last for years to come. Measuring 8\" x 3.5\" x 5.5\", this compact holder will fit perfectly in any bathroom, bedroom, kitchen, craft room, mudroom, or office. With iDesign by InterDesign, you can #LiveSimply every day.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51tRnPeh0bL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"iDesign","source_asin":"B01KHAAII6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-469934","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01KHAAII6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01KHAAII6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
