window.products.push({"id":469941,"name":"Le Creuset Enameled Cast Iron Signature Round Dutch Oven, 1 qt., Flame","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cW3pDw96L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The iconic Le Creuset Dutch oven is indispensable in the kitchens of home cooks and professional chefs alike. Long recognized for its strength and durability, cast iron is the prime material for slow-cooking, braising and roasting, thanks to its ability to maintain even and consistent heat. The enameled Dutch oven needs no seasoning, and it’s suitable for both stovetop and oven use. Le Creuset produced the first enameled cast iron cookware nearly a century ago, and the original foundry still operates today, where 15 skilled artisans hand-inspect each piece. This tradition of the finest culinary craftsmanship, combined with the latest innovations in comfort and functionality, make Le Creuset unsurpassed in both beauty and quality.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cW3pDw96L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Le Creuset","source_asin":"B089GZHY4D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-469941","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089GZHY4D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089GZHY4D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":469942,"name":"BUBIQUER Flannel Backed Vinyl Tablecloth, Waterproof and Oil Proof, Easy to Scrub, Durable and Stable, Table Cover for Indoor and Outdoor Decoration (","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81TdtAm8W2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"How to Choose the Right-Size Tablecloth For Dining Table:  Tablecloth Length=Table Length + 16\"~24\"(40 ~ 60 cm)  Tablecloth Width=Table Width + 16\"~24\"(40 ~ 60 cm)  each end drops approximately 8\" ~ 12\" (20 ~30 cm)  For Tea Table:  Tablecloth Length=Table Length + 8\"~16\"(20~40 cm)  Tablecloth Width=Table Width + 8\"~16\"(20~40 cm)  each end drops approximately 4\"~8\"(10~20 cm)  Tips:  Please measure your tabletop dimensions of length, width before purchasing the tablecloth;  Please allow 1-2 cm error due to manual measurement and the picture may not reflect the actual color as different monitor display and light effect. Washing Tips For the tablecloth is made of cotton linen, hand washing can the best way to maintain and lengthen the life of it.  Of course, you can also put the tablecloth into the laundry bag and wash it with the gentle gear of the washing machine to avoid the strong throwing.  Tumble dry on low heat or lay flat to dry.  To make the tablecloth look smoother, you can also iron it simply.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81TdtAm8W2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BUBIQUER","source_asin":"B08L61MF1Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-469942","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08L61MF1Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08L61MF1Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":469943,"name":"Handmade Ceramic Set of 2 Mug Small Clay Cup with Handle 5oz Multicolor Natural Earthenware Eco Friendly Coffee Lead Free Pottery Handcrafted Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81sth+2F45L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Enjoy your favorite coffee together with this beautiful handmade coffee set! Our cups are created exclusively from natural materials using ancient pottery technology – each cup is formed on the potter's wheel and manually forms the handle - in this case, products are \"drawn out\" by the potter and will not have same shapes. This process has its own advantages, including originality and exclusivity, and of course, the magic of handmade (all pottery goods are unique like snowflakes in nature). After cups get dry, they are baked at 900 degrees Celsius. After that cups are treated with milk and again are baked at 350 degrees (C). Clay treated with milk retains all its good qualities, unlike other finish or glaze. These 100% natural cups will suit everyone! Stylish and small traditional clay cups will become your favorite during coffee breaks and perfectly complement the interior of your kitchen! Clay cups keep the drink hot for a long time and do not change the taste. To clean, use only soft materials and detergents for dishes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81sth+2F45L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MyFancyCraft","source_asin":"B072ZX9DFB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-469943","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B072ZX9DFB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B072ZX9DFB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":469944,"name":"AFI Columbia Staircase Bunk with Turbo Charger and Raised Panel Bed Drawers, Twin/Full, Walnut","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dr+nF+xML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Constructed with solid eco-friendly hardwood in several durable, high-build finishes, the Columbia Bunk Bed can accommodate either under-bed storage drawers or a trundle. With 26 steel reinforcement points, two 14-piece slat kits, and a built-in modesty panel, this bed is as sturdy as they come. A space-saving design with so many sleep options, Atlantic Furniture's Columbia Bunk Bed will become your child's favorite sleepy time fort. Rest easy knowing you can trust this bed's quality, safety, and value. Comes with one set of two underbed drawers. Still need more storage? These beds can accommodate up to four drawers with additional sets sold separately. Attach the included surface mount turbo charger and keep all your electronics charged and ready to go!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dr+nF+xML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AFI","source_asin":"B018NYBH10","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-469944","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B018NYBH10","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B018NYBH10","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":469945,"name":"Forschner/Victorinox Slicer, 10 in Wavy, 1 1/8 in at Rosewood Handle model 40041","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51j+wUyFAjL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The R.H. Forschner collection has grown in size and stature since its name was first carved in steel in 1855. Historically a premier choice of culinary professionals, it is still preferred by professionals today. Renowned for its extremely sharp, Swiss made, steel blades from Victorinox, R.H. Forschner provides professionals in food processing and preparation with superior quality, value-priced cutlery that enhances performance and increases productivity. They are manufactured in Switzerland. The renowned rosewood handles feature a carved handle design with the unique beauty of natural rosewood and are extra durable. The fibrox handles feature a non slip, ergonomic design and are NSF approved. The blades feature a high-carbon no stain steel with the unique Victorinox polished surface and a taper ground edge. Also offering a complete series of slicing and carving knives including the famous granton edge. Wavy Edge knives are especially useful for cutting soft products with a hard crust (bread) or tough skin (sausages and tomatoes) Straight Edge knives are recommended for cutting raw meat, slicing salmon and chopping vegetables. A Straight Edge can be sharpened using a sharpening steel.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51j+wUyFAjL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Victorinox","source_asin":"B00092RF5W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-469945","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00092RF5W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00092RF5W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
